# GludioHold's see-creature hook on a knight (35235): one that sees the character in its first
# AI cycles leaves it alone, as its life time is not past 7 yet; once it is, it still leaves
# alone the character it has in sight (a creature is seen once while it stays). Out of its
# sight and back, the character is seen again, and the settled knight wants to attack it
# with weight 200. Standing on its post with nothing to do, the knight walks there (it is
# there already) and keeps still: GludioHold's no-desire and move-finished hooks queue a
# do-nothing of 40, weight 30, which the cycles after wear down to 28.5.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 150 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300

approach knight
  hate knight 0
  desires knight -

tick x8
  hate knight 0
  desires knight nothing(40)=28.5

away

approach knight
  hate knight 200
  desires knight attack(player)=200 nothing(40)=28.5
